    <!-- 1. Disclosure -->
    <string name="disclosure_title">Important disclosure</string>
    <string name="disclosure_body">This app copies received text SMS messages—including financial, account-recovery, and one-time passcode (OTP) messages—to another phone number you choose, in near real time when private install privileges are complete.\n\nForwarded messages may incur carrier charges on your outbound line. The recipient sees your selected outbound SIM as the sender.\n\nThis app is not the default messaging app. Timely OTP and sensitive SMS require a private installer grant (ADB appops). Without that grant, activation is blocked.\n\nYou will authenticate with your device lock before activation. Pausing never requires authentication.</string>
    <string name="disclosure_otp_note">Timely OTP is required: complete private install (including sensitive-SMS privilege) so OTP-class SMS can be received without becoming the default messaging app.</string>
    <string name="disclosure_accept">I understand and accept</string>

